{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1380,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944e03dd15ff16f80f3f74ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不用多虑。\r\n我必须要变得更强才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8ef0356c0e4939e2cd4f92a88975abefb69a2cc4f77402c79aebb5d6901169a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1b29ffc1a6951eaa09cb53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……身为训练员，\r\n你还是挺值得信赖的……\r\n只、只是说你作为训练员值得信赖哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1682281bd16d86c1344195e45c9eb1d488d62e82e44c24d1fd5f50c7e31e1227",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf723e7b74b9a9c6c814b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练的话就趁现在吧。\r\n我可不想被大家甩下太远……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e85b42dfc046576e453a9bc482018598b3303d0c78f7b393c57c740189bd0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482ff8c3f686fc410e2f07ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，丝带都已经系好了。\r\n快点开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2976bebc17e2ddcd4e81f505bbb933e4d8bef3b0d0ea7437953c8585b17b82f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a91704c2f005c36637b4b53b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原以为运动员用的美甲片\r\n都会很一般……没想到现在一看，\r\n还挺好看的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "010404bc4d66758cc31e4848bf705bcfeec8debbc419c5802f4adc05ccbc06e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e310e86d24cef87cddd41d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身衣服奔跑的话，\r\n仿佛自己也化身为风，\r\n完全不会在意其他人的视线了……吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc881f7f6605ce26d50eee7278b1d617b66fedac80a45c185577c343a50a3f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f0dcebb63d961aba003696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为前辈，现在的我\r\n还没法成为一个优秀的榜样……\r\n还得继续努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba52e5e0153abeee3f688ead8c2a37a300bca1898a869f47296e083f99f0c90d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157e40ff041241b3dbe4ef9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是绕校外奔跑也没关系……\r\n要是事到如今还在意他人的视线，\r\n那只能说明我也还差得远呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a6b706d6ecebc1e9a7dbf7c47f60608b08c96b6a986f8855cbcc7fbb5d50819",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4d380ee7795690c16be1165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近好像没那么反感其他人的视线了……\r\n多亏了赖恩送的这件衣服……\r\n和某人的帮助吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90f45db79f0063069ef93cc59191b00f583d160969457e1a6f1680e6db8e8f1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a226a3f66fb559373282f8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，说说看接下来准备去什么地方吧。\r\n是以前去过的地方？还是没去过的地方？\r\n……哪儿都行啦，快点下决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73c803a4aec6d72581574b8a762eb9e66aba321fbba0a517cda96f1efd67333f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bdf42ed6c1b78af251fde2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好准备了，\r\n什么时候开始训练都可以哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "454de91d31a47760b81735c89e98431ac5e0eb6296be2f934e433e7f3277e07f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5644c8a67a2d57ab040cce1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要变得更强。\r\n……而你就是让我变强的训练员。\r\n训练内容……就交给你安排了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bbb6803318ba542a16b0f65eec90b92193095da06b6e8cf14e0b84213df2df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247d98a61a375ad9bbd30188",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在考虑训练菜单吗？\r\n……没关系，\r\n我一定能好好完成的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccae1d1e33bdd95a658fece5cc5cb227a9026cdda0fd79afaac8cd98c3889724",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6f36f54b7a19fb656e9029",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……因为我信赖着训练员，\r\n我也想要将这份信赖化为实绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe2a4523dbcce2c821e1d579dff28197b276b8621b5caa3b10e5972c8c2a838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f07b6d868d1cd0bac14f9a66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，丝带都已经系好了。\r\n什么时候开始都可以哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "838dea13388d9060546005295a7b147b913d40e8b18701dabce510d1557732bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436e6af05eae09dee732bb67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想让后辈们看看身为前辈的我所付出的努力啊……\r\n我应该能做到的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a68027504861fcb26fa3d9383f477bc189d74eebee7812d0550f0acfe9dc4f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8286229073ff22fd28c5be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近好像没那么反感其他人的视线了。\r\n这多亏了赖恩送的这件衣服……\r\n和训练员的帮助呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe6c8bfdcc05e403f54b954feb2112d48f15f26f00a0a2923d21cc6e955995d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baca0886a7f8d795475663f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来准备去哪儿呢？\r\n是以前去过的地方？还是没去过的地方？\r\n和你一起的话，哪边都行啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "475516648926199a2b1b339a7404306c8bd24c66b7e74e9b2d107f703cbcef1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22c84ecc6283b698324cdcbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能成为我的训练员真是太好啦……\r\n没！我什么都没说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d68259cc0909eaf51c77faf1b78ddf56f5276c357474bcf8414ebe57f0a5bd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:505d2b7bf41b72b790efc56b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能成为我的训练员……真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73ddcc957447a3dc3a280bac6ac39925ad436e348353567b32fb6ba16da1c557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba78662152f52f399fb60ed4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算这样，我还是很感谢你……\r\n我、我才没有撒谎啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f381443525b6fe4e493d76bf3f1d90568532caa7df2d11341591cf75ded2a7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e934dd978ec514ff810ffd31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算这样，我还是很感谢你……谢谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08cad2782e313e6c577f0c81b0cff94b71e5b7c28bf343b85d889042a8757309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4f4fcfceab0a49018a2759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起的话，大概……\r\n能去到世界上的任何地方……吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ab89c0e259143a60baa4a4b0d2503b540f59d54c74888e381f4b62f622610c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac683b884930aa4a84bd6ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一路上所留下的回忆，\r\n就是最棒的伴手礼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "847315d9e3b7a2592e763006c1e02c419088cb12d232dff928b39b7c13c80d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aafe44595f6b7e52c957cfbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起的话，\r\n我们一定能去到世界上的任何地方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba9aa8ae1f060c538ed438ee21cbda78cfd21484dc870acf2b4a0418688ae45c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "93006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7b9a55445466dae9a80d2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我，还是能继续进步的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86da3d77697f39a241618f35108de5a8730c7e4f5e8cb7ec2f8e3721ae9fc7b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13afdefee67edba514eedd65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须要超越自己的极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "faeb84e40799e87b86bf6f3a1c357409fcac7eb3da43422df336a9b9695d958c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a1c4f5901f821c24ef22505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白多伯……嗯。那个，请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b62623111057a3faddb7bb685be3582ccc0bb87198d766882dfe7074c97758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf904b10e90e3b6f970d32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要改变自己……！\r\n所以，我必须要继续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dca829fbce8bb22ba4ff8f1b36550e1ef6fa7579b7884a4da591b736b1060a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24db8b6c57dc86f4eb275879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能做到的事情，变多了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e361b9645dfbae7e806777b1a462464ed4d61f1427ab7d353f28d45933a7a4e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7feaf63bc8ef25a99de17c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想尽一份力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd2adaaf63cc7505cff5d221d39ddfe11332a625220bdfa5c9c40b53e04f22e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dde53fe5a6aa66d7e717577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想再继续冒险……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65356ff64dc5462b72b78fa2249ea29168325a29e4a0ad768098e79a60288d50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bef6a08a361f8d949ac1869d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，\r\n要不要去哪儿玩玩作为纪念？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa37751c0e489cc94d0a0a9ba0753c8accfd70400936d3f0196c7785f2d7f307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d835bb98090d29e22f5507b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去哪儿玩玩吗？\r\n……就当是……转换心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bea6de564881506e1029886db42f56cdec7c9227f4244eebb5c24676d4696b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2985745508ca58d753ee12e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子没问题……\r\n……目白多伯。请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7661a7d43c77812ce285914e6e5466ee35860f28c300bbedf9c9ee6a48fe832a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fbd7d46fc6fd05bc3a3563c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这么做吧ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a30040f9c2e7ee208d423ba5aaf6ed44a624cfc4e1311360628b766e148a0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdb428eddf6f6deb2e26e403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然说这种幼稚的话，\n可不是我的角色。\n…加油哦。和你一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "679c79ce61dfd1a3fa3ce7beaa1b0174792a1acf1ad5c8214ff7fb816f53da24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a61a7453f72bbd85f4db2f38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくんねー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e992b661980cfdc645293714d6dcb74716c24bc66579c780a165c1440c12bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335249237667497c498df760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4c0649e6387931d57dd3b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蹄铁又小了呢。\n要不要再一起去买？\n…那家服装店也顺便去一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beba73cb3a6e6ec3d2e136852dff786a04682a5fce7049c15b184f334d6b5d59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ed8a1ad9289f7107e4412c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到盂兰盆会舞的时候，\n就练习舞蹈吧。然后下次\n一起跳舞吧。一定会很愉快的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbca66ddd510af6040d70387c4885248346fd4fa57c4ab5d606ec8fa7f33a63d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f94ae1298f47305869acc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n今年也请多多关照。\n这样的话要好好说啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a397266906500ec2e10228566c6fecd6eaf4cc0c29ace91df0e4ac79f97ec5fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f883539fdb8c0e353f3fcdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是哦，今天不是情人节吗。\n…啊，太过遥远忘掉了。\n晚上会有降价巧克力卖吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1654483a3111fcfbff4b6cd9195446dab8451359ba5cd50d3ed8fe054a1f9b9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7088dbd35cf9dfb79caa550",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，那个。…你想要\n我的巧克力吗？\n在那张桌子…放着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6e7af5fc59163f48962a03658a505e9863b4e592f637293c4072035d4f30a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616e9c4bbc83e2682af3c93b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星啊，闪闪发光的\n非常漂亮呢。\n…非常非常的高，高到够不着呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3e0488753ff070feec45f85cce0ab3ac798b7dc5dfe91696e4192ef7dfcdf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001d18641a0a2215ec33525d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果用醋海带代替点心的话，\n乌拉拉会很高兴的吧～。\n…呵呵。还有一个给你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8be4a382495a898388ca5e8818ff2c182589f0ddcc8246d37a0ab6b856ea235",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7241adf1235ca970e085339b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的好的，圣诞快乐ー。\n圣诞老人，能给我\n一个纯真的礼物吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cde14cffeccfbd3abb21a787b7461a30d262f3d2794694e433bc915c4ed4db6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:379289c6309fc92332245af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。这样的日子都还在工作？\n…嘛，心地善良的圣诞老人\n会给你送炸鸡吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9dc286636b32cd6edadc6dee57600d4a13a2e68c7e114f8c376c77a853a1d34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fae3fa53f647b8f24a5eb68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可贺啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a30cb8c29d21fd8ec26baf85a49eb34036d6a6f1b62aa7cd0ff58d7c8c2816d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab241622c23f43e9006e3c90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "额，已经是年末了？…哈啊ー。\n感觉一年比一年过得更快了\n…啊，去年也说过这个。害怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f874a85ff86795f7e6939e9ade5be0e8d12d3ba3bba6d63579df4d68c2375e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dbaa5b3c6c2f6a1ab09cd0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来，今天不是生日吗？\n哎呀ー，可喜可贺。\n来吃肉包子吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2834f24a46948fb8dcd67cb3a773280f96063396cacbd51414b82ebb5d357773",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4661fc5b32e8a55e1b5a0d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，生日快乐\n也要感谢你的父母哦。\n…那么！一起吃蛋糕吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9590a98efd0a6b2277cc739567c06dc08929c9589927055c7defdc223629e60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33de2a4d1678d75c706916fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的生日…大家不是\n更兴奋吗？开派对的时候\n…主角都还没习惯呢。真是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17e6f5bc2db6184c29921a9dc881ac4665f717bc0155b210756ef349557c0d21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67803e4bf56897fbeb3497aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶？生日的祝福？啊ー，嗯…\n怎么感觉，很害羞呢。\n…总，总之谢谢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e0d871d46da165907279a316240e0f42f2632a58a0c8889d3604a635e32bd82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee1e4e32b4508974767a794b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\n没有错过什么通知吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13bdca1001b969f3a188361c7849a3786aae6e8d92620465d8757eb346e97f59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772d3db551ecce606a2a564c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！好像收到了\n什么好东西啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ea9a4826f59d9b8ba94ce0c14a6414bce5ca005a055f4a6ad4490d3bbc065d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266a517c6c0795b880b73a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了嘛。\n…呵呵。加油哦，\n有人一直在看着你呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a0f3d1fce913506500315f4dd02de9d0026eb44e4b06110bd0bc071ebf9647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb068c6c5f8cb0613618151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动准备中…啊。\n会做什么呢？\n能悠哉悠哉的就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe1c70fad70ff95af89b64cc767b55bfa7eeabacdf8ab8027c9cb71d756e1d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d581e823c34113f81dc6e285",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在举办活动吗？\n感觉哪里很热闹呢。\n…探个头去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1983187bf1e360fb339a0106b5efcc9431a13d4b8caa7928b96ed8926c23e57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d30e1bcb0140659caf58b461",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー可恶…",
      "source_fingerprint": "045985ed9fd7889f36064a9cf008d53d9a8c622f671bdd71a0ac1511924698bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739b41ae6293fff20cce301c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！名鉴等级，\n不是很高嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18fde15e211e9bca67048398a974759f25159feffb5afe34c8627412c274b458",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60a3f1d3b1c25eb4939134a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还是喜欢轻松穿了就能出门的\r\n衣服呢～华丽的款式我就不用了。\r\n简单就是最好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13bdc5b5f85bd42eced34ac015840343fec00b8efd77a98aeab0efc225a47726",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2e67f6bd63b8579d982d45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前一群高中生围着我，不停叫着\r\n「便服好可爱！」……现在想起来，\r\n还是觉得很不好意思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0a27984387103159dfbc5172800020a03141503f4066b75e31ab14bfca6bc4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce9a6f944f2b28c53a8e9e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正玩乐不是唯一的放松方式，\r\n偶尔也会想要漫无目的地到处\r\n漫步呢……要一起来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87050161937c7d5321326846f47710260a8f524bff87e3d4f778ea64ab999a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4b4d1eb0ce9ca5b6d6fe135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别在意别在意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "881f7b5b03a92e71cc98c5ea0405e9dc82698168e5f42df42d207bb54b599c7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f51c28f8e6988490b8f1af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，大巨星～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e1128bd5d6cbc373e354b38e3d8fe9ee7cc0be42c800abf7b89a1e9711f3927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eef8d7731348f8e9ba4e32e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー可恶…",
      "source_fingerprint": "045985ed9fd7889f36064a9cf008d53d9a8c622f671bdd71a0ac1511924698bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af44085ce7263a2667c8b16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别在意别在意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "881f7b5b03a92e71cc98c5ea0405e9dc82698168e5f42df42d207bb54b599c7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff29d8fc270972756949063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝贺！评分更新♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa795251b2d6a4af47d6315604f6ce8af8ade6ff32e31e8b626370d5d2b87a1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd74783529969c6db0b81eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢慢地，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fb8a181bf936411134ba83d13b8d5ddca0ec3defecaa13ce6866b8983df2c2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af5571116e79ccc95042f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf0c6d833d6ab5b205a03519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟，要训练吗？\n要工作呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dc0f43bdcd3908e9ffb0173cf07f7192b505f451c02310a21422be681e1d9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:706ea48ea53eae45c20b735b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也让我听听，你回忆里的故事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d26ee97565928bf564c3c82acab9c6c63adcfaed9007c957451ce8da33685fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7e317fb96a01068fdc99753",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，要参加比赛吗？\n很有干劲呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c236ab8728b887d057cfe97c10d574a65f8108a175bf0d10f5e1099bd69094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f558392d8dc9056f359d7f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈，真有精神呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "066d723f355e46f20adb251056f961a4c86385ffcc58f05d0735d431b4880925",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54cfe32f0b87ab58b09fd129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮状态不是很好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54deacb0d3f823c74f7b07712448b51eb4bbea55c4fe03d409940e505533ee2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
